              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "umugabo ni yasezeranira Uhoraho isezerano, cank’ akarahira indahiro, akībohesha ivyo araganye, ntaz’ ace mw ijambo ryiwe, arikw az’ ashitse ivyamuvuye mu kanwa vyose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ umukobga ni yasezeranira Uhoraho isezerano, akībohesha ivyo araganye, akiri mu rugo kwa se mu bgigeme bgiwe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "se akumva ivyo asezeranye, n’ingene yibohesheje ivyo araganye, agapfa kwihorera akamureka, ayo masezerano yiwe yose azohama, bo n’ivyo yaraganye vyose yibohesheje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko se ni yamubuza kur’ uwo musi avyumviyeko, ntihazogira isezerano ryiwe rihama, canke na kimwe mu vyo yaraganye yari yibohesheje; Uhoraho azomuharira kuko se yamubujije.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
